# scripts/opcount: NR1's receipt (NAMED-ROWS): `namedrowbench bench spelled
# N` makes N calls that fail the same six error types, the row spelled, and
# catches each by its type; the cost of one call is the slope between the
# two sizes. The control is the named kind's: Go writes both one way.
unit call
sizes 409600 2457600
args bench spelled {n}
control benchmarks/namedrow/testdata/control
